    "text": "안녕하세요.",
    "translation": "hello."
  },
  {
    "time": "2026-03-19T09:04:00.190786+00:00",
    "text": "저는, 다현이라고 합니다.",
    "translation": "My name is Dahyun."
  },
  {
    "time": "2026-03-19T09:04:02.964035+00:00",
    "text": "저 헬로우만",
